	(text "System-5 BUS, Rev D (S5BUS-D, 2026): eight 36-pin slots, every pin bussed. Slot positions 4-33 are the 30-pin System-5 bus (+5V at 4, GND at 33)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "435cf13d-3be9-5d54-bdfc-2f99e73dac32"))
	(text "Positions 1-3: -EF1, -EF2, -EF3 (the outer end; -EF3 next to +5V). Positions 34-36: -PAUSE, -DMAIN, SC0 (the 36-pin extension). A 30-pin card plugs into positions 4-33." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0729c128-3da1-5a9a-9241-ba31e8252d2c"))
	(text "Power: +5V and GND on the screw terminal J9, through the power switch SW1, F1 (4 A polyfuse) and Q1 (P-MOSFET: off if the supply is reversed). 220 uF bulk C1, 0.1 uF at each slot (C2-C9), power LED D1. No regulator." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6a1d8985-0cfa-5cf4-a4c5-5690ca2699e0"))
	(text "Pull-ups (10k): RN1 on D0-D7 (an empty read gives FF); RN2 on the open-collector lines -EF, -EF1-3, -PAUSE, -DMAIN, -INT, -RESET (they also hold with the CPU card out). Idle states with no master: RN3 pulls N0-N2, TPA, TPB down; RN4 pulls -VMA, -MRD, -MRW up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bb19b71a-4ed9-556e-b263-1f70ee90b413"))
	(text "Pin numbers here are socket positions, not the 2009 Eagle numbers (docs/manual/bus.md). Generated by gen/make_schematic.py from gen/netlist.py." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "eeb91b4d-d310-5c74-9f96-e1fca3bc5ac6"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
